  "source": "[A \\.set.difference./ B]\nDefines: D is \\set\nwhen: A, B is \\set\nexpresses:\n. let: x is \\set\n  then:\n  . have: x \"in\"? D\n    iff:\n    . x \"in\"? A\n    . not: x \"in\"? B\nDocumented:\n. called: \"set difference of $A?$ and $B?$\"\n. written: \"A? \\setminus B?\"\n. description: \"The set difference (relative complement) $A \\setminus B$ is the\n                set of elements that belong to $A$ but do not belong to $B$.\"\nId: \"186de027-9bf6-422d-a2ed-823c94a80b1b\"",
